' v1.2's production choice (`preset classic|extended ai amiga seed 3 start 30 party give
' item_rat_trap`: a prepared state, not the game's): the companion `party` hands
' over is camped at Paradise Camp, where the human starts, and the given rat
' trap is put down in the tent. Rats now make at least as much
' as maggots. In INFO the camp is automatic (no slot chosen); a left click picks
' the first product, maggots: the player's own choice (`SelectProduction`), which
' the day keeps while it makes anything — two days later it is still maggots
' (the save says `production 0 … manual`). Then a right click on the first slot
' gives the choice back (`SelectAutomaticFoodProduction`): the best is taken
' and the save no longer says `manual`. `v12_production_choice_part` stops at
' the first save.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
join                     ' camped here: the place is ours
wait 10
mapclick 177,150         ' the tent
wait 200
uiclick 168,248          ' the rat trap put down
wait 5
esc
wait 10
menu 300,150
menuline 1               ' INFO (v1.2's menu: FIGHT first)
wait 3
sceneclick 246,121       ' automatic, so the first product: maggots, by choice
wait 3
sceneclick 20,185        ' back
wait 5
esc
wait 20
day
wait 30
day
wait 30
save                     ' day 3: still maggots, manual
wait 10
mapclick 110,122         ' back in
wait 60
menu 300,150
menuline 1               ' INFO (v1.2's menu: FIGHT first)
wait 3
rsceneclick 246,121      ' right click on the first: automatic
wait 3
sceneclick 20,185
wait 5
esc
wait 20
day
wait 30
save                     ' day 4: automatic, the best production
